{"id":"anwesenheit","lemma":"Anwesenheit","pos":"noun","rank":2649,"glosses":["presence"],"ipa":"/ˈanˌveːzn̩haɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4c/De-Anwesenheit.ogg/De-Anwesenheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Anwesenheit"},"examples":[{"text":"Seine Anwesenheit war mir nicht bewusst.","en":"I was not conscious of his presence.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"conscious, aware"}]},{"text":"Ihre Anwesenheit macht mich immer nervös.","en":"I always get nervous in her presence.","words":[{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"nervous"}]},{"text":"Ich habe eure Anwesenheit wirklich genossen.","en":"I really enjoyed your company.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"your","l":"euer"},null,{"g":"really, actually"},{"g":"partner in something","l":"Genosse"}]},{"text":"Der Lehrer überprüfte die Anwesenheit.","en":"The teacher called the roll.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"to teach","l":"lehren"},{"g":"to check, to verify","l":"überprüfen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Lass dich von meiner Anwesenheit nicht irritieren.","en":"Please don't mind me.","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to confuse"}]}]}